# The sdist holds only what builds the wheel. setuptools adds the metadata
# files itself, and by default also tests/test*.py, which cannot run without
# the rest of the test suite and the mock server, so prune them. Anything
# else stays out because no rule includes it. Keep the patterns ASCII.
include LICENSE README.md pyproject.toml
recursive-include files_sdk *.py *.json
prune tests
